{"id":"58c4ff1898820e8c","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion.md","title":"CE Decidable Criterion","display":"cor-ce-decidable-criterion — CE Decidable Criterion","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion","aliases":["92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion"],"display":"cor-ce-decidable-criterion — CE Decidable Criterion","depends_on":["[[92-lem-ce-not-decidable]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]"],"source":"第 IV 章附录 p. 53（PDF 70）；并行算法为本地重构","source_status":"原书递归性刻画的计算解释"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ce-decidable-criterion — CE Decidable Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0173be2f9b9b066\" href=\"?note=f0173be2f9b9b066\" title=\"92-lem-ce-not-decidable\">92-lem-ce-not-decidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章附录 p. 53（PDF 70）；并行算法为本地重构"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书递归性刻画的计算解释"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (computably enumerable and decidable predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可判定集判定准则：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^c\">\\(A^c\\)</span>都是r.e.</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ul>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^c\">\\(A^c\\)</span>都可枚举（模拟判定器）</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^c\">\\(A^c\\)</span>都可枚举，则可判定（并行枚举）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>应用于某个理论的定理码集之前，须分别证明该码集c.e.且其补集非c.e.；“Gödel集”这一非固定名称本身不足以推出结论</li>\n<li>该准则可把特定可证性问题的不可判定性转化为补集不可枚举性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>并行枚举的完整性说明：给定 A 与其补集的两个枚举过程，输入 n 后交替推进各过程一步；n 必定属于其中恰好一个集合，故有限时间内在相应过程出现并输出成员位。不能顺序先运行一个可能永不输出 n 的过程。若其中一个集合为空，另一个是 ℕ，此时常值判定器直接处理；这与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a> 对空集的单独约定相容。反方向由总判定器筛选递增自然数，非空集合可生成总递归枚举函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书的 R 与补 R 都 Σ₁ 定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a>。本文用两个枚举算法给出其判定思想；应用到某个定理集时，仍须另证该集的有效枚举及不可判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-ce-not-decidable","status":"resolved","id":"f0173be2f9b9b066","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-ce-not-decidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"并行枚举的完整性说明：给定 A 与其补集的两个枚举过程，输入 n 后交替推进各过程一步；n 必定属于其中恰好一个集合，故有限时间内在相应过程出现并输出成员位。不能顺序先运行一个可能永不输出 n 的过程。若其中一个集合为空，另一个是 ℕ，此时常值判定器直接处理；这与 [[92-df-ce-set]] 对空集的单独约定相容。反方向由总判定器筛选递增自然数，非空集合可生成总递归枚举函数。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书的 R 与补 R 都 Σ₁ 定义见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]。本文用两个枚举算法给出其判定思想；应用到某个定理集时，仍须另证该集的有效枚举及不可判定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^c","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^c","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^c","display":false}],"bytes":2022,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-ce-decidable-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["f0173be2f9b9b066","b090f61b9f3ec664","69a2a133da01f9c9","cc77d3ecb4f82cf1"]}